          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Blast off into space on an exciting but cozy adventure in this relaxing bedtime story! You’ll step aboard a shiny spaceship, snuggle into a comfy seat, and prepare for a peaceful journey through the stars. \n\nHelp prepare the spaceship for takeoff: press the buttons, close the hatch, and snuggle under warm covers as the spacecraft smoothly lifts off into space. With the gentle hum of the engines and the stars outside, it’s the perfect way to drift off to sleep. \n\nAfter the story, the soft sounds of the spaceship gliding through space will continue playing for a whole hour, keeping you relaxed and calm until you're fast asleep. \n\nVoiced by Harriet Blackamore, Sound Design by Emma Mills, Written & Produced by Neil Mossey.",
